o/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Catharsio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Catharsio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Catharsio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Catharsio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Catharsio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T16:02:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T16:02:01Z","body":"I have ported the project to 5.4.1 stable (it went quicker than expected). Somebody on a discord has had also experienced the same issue and oddly enough, it also persisted in 5.4.1. I removed VSCode as the selected editor in editor settings and regenerated the solution. So far the issue hasn't popped up again. So far it appears that VSCode was acting up all along, as expected. Suffice to say, thanks for the ideas. I will close the issue for now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3796870078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]